---
import SectionTitle from '../common/SectionTitle.astro';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-16 transition-colors duration-300 md:py-20" id="contact">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-fuchsia-500/10 to-cyan-400/10"></div>
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-cyan-100 bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-sm md:p-12 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-zinc-900/40 dark:shadow-none">
      <SectionTitle titleKey="cta.title" centered>
        <span slot="title">
          <span class="text-black dark:text-white" data-i18n="cta.title">Construyamos algo</span>
        </span>
      </SectionTitle>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-black dark:text-black" data-i18n="cta.description">
        Actualmente busco nuevas oportunidades y colaboraciones. Ya sea que tengas un
        proyecto en mente o solo quieras charlar, mi bandeja de entrada siempre está abierta.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-4 md:flex-row">
        <a
          href="mailto:d.pereznavarro15@gmail.com"
          class="btn-primary flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">send</span>
          <span data-i18n="cta.button_contact">Ponerse en Contacto</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&id=1RqMs5BImz87nRbuVv260V8QCWqOgz5gH"
          class="btn-secondary flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">download</span>
          <span data-i18n="cta.button_cv">Descargar CV</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>